@id=declared-maturity-derived-stage @kind=decision
Feature: Maturity is a judgement, declared and checked only to be a rung; that it works is derived

  Not one status field, which rots, nor criteria for each rung, which a placeholder paragraph with a
  token scenario meets: how far work still to come has come is a human judgement, declared and
  checked only to be a rung of the team's ladder, never for what it claims, and built work declares
  none, since it is a live test whose stage is derived from its run. The price is that sdp cannot
  tell a draft from a ready spec, so a team that must holds its maturities to a gate of its own, and
  that a spec is verified only in a checkout where its scenarios ran.
